 "notes": "Hybrid UIKit (SceneCoordinator.Scene enum -> VC) + SwiftUI (MastodonNavigationDestination enum + navigationDestination). route_id for UIKit is the VC class; scene_case gives the enum case as alternate id. NO accessibilityIdentifier anywhere: testids intentionally empty (UI tests use localized labels like app.buttons[\"Log In\"] which are NOT testIDs) -> any extracted testid is a false positive. API paths are appendingPathComponent onto endpointURL \"https://{domain}/api/v1/\" so label paths include /api/v1 prefix; scorer strips /api/vN prefix when comparing."
}